  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in the share of critical shipments routed through the Strait concentrates reliance on that corridor (and on a narrower set of alternative routes), raising geographic concentration of supply chains relevant to China.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">hormuz_standoff</data>
