  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher oil export volumes support larger sovereign-wealth and petrodollar capital flows from Gulf actors into overseas tech assets and funds, increasing the embedding of AI infrastructure and revenue streams into global financial markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
