  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in oil prices feeds through to headline inflation and inflation expectations, prompting central banks to tighten policy (raise rates or reduce accommodation) to anchor inflation.</data>
