  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained higher oil prices stemming from Hormuz disruptions boost Russian hydrocarbon revenues and fiscal headroom, enabling faster procurement, sortie rates, or replenishment of munitions and drones used in strikes in the Russia–Ukraine theatre.</data>
