  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in hostile incidents in the Strait (attacks, seizures, spills) raises insurance and security costs and forces rerouting and delays, directly reducing the volume and velocity of cross‑border maritime trade to and from China in the near term.</data>
