  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in hostile attacks and shipping losses raises risk premia and real-time market uncertainty, triggering rapid reallocations into safe-haven assets (sovereign bonds, gold, USD) by investors and funds.</data>
