  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased maritime attacks raise insurance and shipping-risk premiums and intermittently block sea lanes, delaying deliveries of GPUs and other specialized hardware and thereby slowing planned expansions of aggregate AI compute capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
