  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Disruptions that reduce throughput at the Black Sea chokepoint force cargo rerouting through alternate Asia‑Pacific corridors and ports, increasing cross‑border transits and transactional trade volume in the Chinese maritime region.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">china_maritime_pressure</data>
</edge>
