  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained higher throughput through key chokepoints reduces delivery and valuation uncertainty for AI hardware, making lenders and asset managers more willing to accept AI infrastructure as collateral or securitize related revenue streams, whereas throughput disruptions reverse that trend.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
