  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Cuts or disruptions to Russian fuel exports push importers to replace lost barrels with crude and products from Gulf suppliers, increasing volumes routed through the Strait of Hormuz as trade is reallocated.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
</edge>
