  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A drop in fuel exports pushes up regional and global energy prices and volatility, raising projected operating costs and margins for hyperscale AI data centers and prompting banks and investors to delay or reduce new financing commitments for AI infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
