  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising market perception of conflict escalation triggers rapid reallocations into perceived safe assets (USD, core sovereign bonds, gold), increasing safe-haven demand flows almost immediately.</data>
