<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::financial_integration" target="global_monetary_stress::monetary_policy_tightnes" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater embedding of AI infrastructure and model revenue into tradable securities and bank balance sheets amplifies credit- and wealth-effects during AI-driven asset booms, raising inflationary and financial-stability pressures that push central banks toward tighter policy.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_monetary_stress</data>
</edge>
