  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A decline in cross‑border trade volumes reduces FX liquidity and widens short‑term currency volatility around trade settlements, prompting central banks and fiscal authorities to increase the frequency and scale of market interventions to stabilize exchange rates and liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_maritime_pressure</data>
  <data key="d39">global_monetary_stress</data>
