  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained reduction in Chinese cross-border trade lowers demand for Gulf energy and transshipment flows to/from East Asia, directly reducing the volume of commercial vessel transits through the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
