  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A drop in regional semiconductor production directly reduces availability of accelerators and custom AI chips, constraining providers' ability to deploy new training/inference capacity and slowing overall compute growth.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_maritime_pressure</data>
