  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A tighter monetary stance raises policy rates and borrowing costs and increases discount rates, directly reducing new debt and equity commitments to capital‑intensive AI infrastructure projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
