  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased public‑sector market interventions that include targeted lending, guarantees or purchase programs for strategic sectors channel state liquidity and credit toward AI infrastructure providers, directly boosting financing availability.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
