  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp net capital outflows raise the cost and reduce availability of trade finance (letters of credit, short-term bank lines) for importers and exporters, producing an immediate fall in cross-border shipments and invoiced trade volumes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_stress</data>
