  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp net capital outflows reduce availability of trade finance and letters-of-credit for exporters and shipping companies (including those facilitating regional trade), producing immediate reductions in booked voyages and cargo volumes transiting chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_monetary_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
